    "text": "By Taylor Lewis ,\n12 hours ago VALDOSTA, Ga. (WALB) — The executive director of The Haven, a dual domestic violence shelter and sexual assault center, said the agency is operating over capacity and could lose positions if a disregarded $9.4 million state allocation is not restored. Michelle Gertman has led The Haven for 30 years.... Read full article\n7",
